  {
    "field": "argument_node.doc",
    "value": "With the empty set in the class, a VC bound of one makes any two points of a common member comparable in the membership order: otherwise the four assembled patterns shatter the pair."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {α : Type u_1} [DecidableEq α] {𝒜 : Set (Set α)},\n  StructuralIgnorance.vcBounded 𝒜 1 →\n    ∅ ∈ 𝒜 →\n      ∀ {a b : α}, (∃ S ∈ 𝒜, a ∈ S ∧ b ∈ S) → StructuralIgnorance.memOrder 𝒜 a b ∨ StructuralIgnorance.memOrder 𝒜 b a"
